# - Bushes block sight. When a fight is not in our favour, a champion steps
#   into a nearby bush instead of running in the open. From there it only
#   hits enemies that walk into its attack range (ambush from fog).
# - When the local fight favours us (local_strength), we commit: stun and
#   damage abilities first, then basic attacks on the weakest enemy.
# - While farming or tributing, each champion places its ward on the
#   nearest bush within 2 tiles, so enemies cannot hide there and ambush us.
# - Farm the closest unclaimed non-monolith camp. Capture cleared camps.
#   Tribute at 35+ gems, or with any gems late in the game.
# - At low health, hide in a bush if enemies are near, otherwise recall.
#   Heal fully on spawn and spend all gold on strength shards there.

def use_slot(s, t):
  if ability_ready(s):
    if slot_is_damage(s) or slot_is_stun(s) or slot_is_aoe(s):
      if distance(position(), unit_position(t)) <= slot_range(s):
        cast_at_unit(s, t)
